WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.930
- My name is Ryan, and
I've never eaten fruit.

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.210
It's just something that I've never

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.330
wanted to do before this.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:09.580
My parents have definitely
tried to get me to eat fruit,

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.653
but I've absolutely rejected that.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.933
Yup.

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:20.260
I want to eat fruit, because I really feel

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.650
like I'll feel better about
myself, I'll look better.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.730
So, I'm here today 'cause I
really want to give it a go,

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.460
and I think it's gonna
help me in the long run.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.163
Do you believe in me as my father?

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.460
I'm extremely scared.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.710
The texture kind of scares me.

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.450
I mean, what's going on
here with this pineapple?

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.560
I just don't like fruit.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.393
It's that simple.

00:00:45.393 --> 00:00:48.657
But today, I'm gonna risk
it all and try some fruit.

00:00:48.657 --> 00:00:52.324
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:57.123
A blueberry?

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:57.963
Is that correct?

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:00.910
I don't like it already.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.140
It's leaking.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:04.110
It's got a little hole right here.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.630
This is the first time I'm ever trying,

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:07.130
all right, it just leaked out.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.870
Mm, it smells good.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:10.803
First fruit ever.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.503
Here I go.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:25.483
That wasn't bad.

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:27.820
I almost gagged at first.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:28.653
Did you see that?

00:01:28.653 --> 00:01:29.830
I really don't have anything

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:30.800
much to say about the blueberry.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.050
I'm not blown away by it.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.610
A five, but I am proud of
myself for trying that,

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.100
because

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.150
it was small, but it was scary at first.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:41.160
That's my first fruit.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.570
- [Director] Hell, yeah, all right.

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:43.604
- I just tried a fruit.

00:01:43.604 --> 00:01:45.270
- [Director] Good step,
you just tried a fruit,

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:46.603
easy.
- Ugh.

00:01:49.228 --> 00:01:50.061
All right.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:53.800
I know it's a fucking grape, thank you.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.110
Maybe I should cut this in half.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:56.943
Thank you.

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:06.600
There's that gag reflex again.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:07.830
See, my eye are watering.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.290
That was like, you bite into it,

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:12.250
and it's just like an
explosion of grapefication.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:13.500
I would still have to grade it at four.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.790
The blueberry was better.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:15.623
Next fruit.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.210
It smells sweet.

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.770
This is a big piece,

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:21.970
but I'm gonna go for it.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:27.400
I kinda like that.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.190
I think that's number one so far.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.430
That goes above the blueberry.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:32.830
I'm gonna give the strawberry a seven.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:34.680
Oh God.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.040
What the fuck is that?

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.230
Okay, what the fuck is this?

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:40.120
This looks like a sea creature.

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.170
It smells kinda good.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.250
Oh, oh my God, I hate that.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.940
The texture of this is so weird

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.563
that it feels like it's alive.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:54.900
It's not on the scale.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:55.793
It's a zero.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:00.073
Is this a mango?

00:03:00.073 --> 00:03:02.580
I like that it doesn't have seeds

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:04.503
or eggs or anything crazy in it.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:08.360
That's not how I expected it to taste.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:09.820
It tastes a little like, sour-y.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:10.997
I was telling my friends, I was like,

00:03:10.997 --> 00:03:12.777
"I really think I'm
gonna connect with mango,

00:03:12.777 --> 00:03:16.420
"on a different level," and
that's not what happened today.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.777
We were rooting for you, mango.

00:03:18.777 --> 00:03:21.210
Oh,

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:22.350
it's an apple.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:24.700
Doesn't smell like apple
juice right now to me.

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:27.820
That tastes like apple juice.

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.380
I, you know, makes sense.

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:31.220
That was, that was pretty, I like that.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.540
I definitely like the crunchier ones.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.450
And now, I can envision
my future with apples.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.780
Like, people dip them in peanut butter.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.960
What else do you have back there?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.940
This is the one that I know
is gonna give me problems.

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:44.230
I do not like banana.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:45.260
Look at this thing.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.040
This is gonna give me a problem.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.660
I,

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:49.970
I don't like the smell of them,

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.640
I don't like the peeling.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:53.473
I don't

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:56.230
like how obnoxious it looks.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:58.140
Because I've done so much, and I've

00:03:58.140 --> 00:03:59.690
conquered all those fruit, I'm actually

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.040
gonna eat this whole thing.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.440
I hate, I hate that.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:08.273
Too soft.

00:04:08.273 --> 00:04:10.700
Too like, gooey, too slimy.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:11.890
I like orange juice.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.730
This is why I'm so like, messed up.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.300
Hopefully it tastes like a screwdriver,

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:17.200
without the vodka.

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:21.600
Mm, that was good.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:22.550
I really like that.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.330
Yeah, can I try another piece of it?

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.930
This is where I'm at right now.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:30.500
I have just tried an
orange, a legit orange,

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.760
and now, I'm asking for another orange.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:35.290
Out of 10 I'm gonna give it a 10.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.210
There's a seed in this.

00:04:46.354 --> 00:04:47.740
I didn't really like that.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:49.140
It's a little spongy.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.423
A watermelon is definitely a hard three.

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:55.070
My friend, Carly, is like
obsessed with pineapples.

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:56.860
She always says that I'm gonna love them.

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.700
The pineapple is so extra.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:02.690
Like, can we just take a
second to talk about this.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.190
It smells really good, though.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:10.770
Mm.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:14.393
Oh, I'll have another,
if I don't say so myself.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.540
I feel like this is another 10.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:20.619
This and orange are gonna
be my go to, I think.

00:05:20.619 --> 00:05:21.753
(sigh) I did it.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.220
I just tried 10 fruit.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.053
My whole life, I've seen fruit,

00:05:26.053 --> 00:05:27.947
I'm like, "I'm not going near that.

00:05:27.947 --> 00:05:29.090
"I don't want to try that."

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.940
And I just tried 10, so
I'm really proud of myself.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.200
This could open up new possibilities

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.790
of trying new foods
with different textures.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.623
So, I just tried 10 fruit.

00:05:40.294 --> 00:05:41.550
(laughs)

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.393
They almost had to at some point.

00:05:48.784 --> 00:05:51.458
(friends cheer)

00:05:51.458 --> 00:05:55.291
(triumphant orchestral music)

